+## V43.4 Executive Recommendation Engine
+Turns insights into governed recommendations with confidence, expected impact, approval requirements, and evidence.
+
+## V43.5 Executive Decision Workspace
+Combines the live brief, portfolio risk queue, insights, recommendations, and decision gate into one persistable executive decision package.
+
+Build: `43.5.0-executive-decision-intelligence`
